# Project Structure and Architecture

## Architecture Overview

This project follows **Clean Architecture** with **MVVM** pattern:

- **Domain Layer** (`domain/`): Business logic, entities, use cases, repository interfaces (no Android framework types)
- **Data Layer** (`data/`): Repository implementations, data sources (local/remote), DTOs
- **Presentation Layer** (`presentation/`): UI components, ViewModels, screens, navigation

## Directory Structure

```
app/src/main/java/dev/sonle/pdfscanner/
├── core/                          # Core functionality
│   ├── di/                        # Koin dependency injection modules
│   ├── network/                   # Network utilities (optional / legacy)
│   ├── database/                  # Room database configuration
│   ├── scanner/                   # Document detection & image processing
│   └── util/                      # Utility classes
├── data/                          # Data layer
│   ├── local/                     # Local data sources (Room)
│   ├── remote/                    # Remote data sources (if used)
│   ├── model/                     # DTOs and Entities
│   └── repository/                # Repository implementations
├── domain/                        # Domain layer
│   ├── model/                     # Domain models
│   ├── repository/                # Repository interfaces
│   ├── navigation/                # Typed navigation routes
│   └── usecase/                   # Use cases
└── presentation/                  # Presentation layer
    ├── components/                # Reusable UI components
    ├── features/                  # Feature modules (main, scanner, viewer)
    ├── navigation/                # Navigation graph & Navigator
    └── theme/                     # Theme and styling
```

